OpenBMC source provenance
=========================

The HID keysym mapping in src/keymap.cpp, src/keymap.hpp, and
src/scancodes.hpp is derived from OpenBMC obmc-ikvm:

  https://github.com/openbmc/obmc-ikvm
  commit ec3fad81ca9071a87e0a0b5744b1d066f30cc012

The LibVNCServer lifecycle and Tight JPEG forwarding design in
src/vnc_server.cpp is also derived from that revision's ikvm_server.cpp.
OneKVM replaces OpenBMC's V4L2, USB gadget, D-Bus, Boost, and phosphor logging
integration with OneKVM media IPC and its authenticated HID administration
socket. OneKVM's modifications are distributed under GPL-2.0-only.
